Colour palette
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The warm neutrals and the clay accent follow Anthropic's published brand
palette. The specific values in assets/dark.css and assets/light.css were
derived from it and then adjusted for contrast; they are not a verbatim copy of
any published token set.
